OL,3,GNEWSALockdown puppy leads woman to
OL,4,Ainternational husky racing
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Danielle Marshall picked up her
OL,7,Fnew puppy Luna in 2020, she had no idea
OL,8,Fit would lead to her representing her
OL,9,Fcountry in sled dog racing.
OL,11,FThe 32-year-old, from Worksop in
OL,12,FNottinghamshire, was looking for ways
OL,13,Fto tire out her energetic and
OL,14,Fheadstrong new husky cross.
OL,16,FShe found groups of other owners who
OL,17,Fwere running with their dogs tied to
OL,18,Ftheir waists, so she thought she would
OL,19,Fgive it a go with Luna.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
